flowchart TD
  Request[AI request] --> Flag[Feature flag check]
  Flag --> RBAC[requireUser / requireRole]
  RBAC --> Limit[checkAiRateLimit()\nlib/ai/rateLimitGuard.ts]
  Limit --> Budget[Monthly AI budget check]
  Budget --> Mode{Grounded RAG?}
  Mode -- Yes --> Scope[Audience scope + retrieval mode]
  Scope --> Retrieve[retrieveRelevantChunks()]
  Retrieve --> Trust[answerGroundedQuestion()\nconfidence + grounding + citations]
  Trust --> Log[Audit + AiInteractionLog]
  Mode -- No --> Router[routedCompletion()]
  Router --> Log
  Log --> Response[Safe response]
